menu "Desk Buddy appearance"

    choice BUDDY_THEME
        prompt "Screen theme"
        default BUDDY_THEME_PAPER
        help
            The colours the face and its widgets are drawn with.
            Paper is warm off-white for daytime. Ember is warm near-black
            with a brighter face, for a desk at night. Palettes and their
            contrast checks are in main/face/face_theme.h and docs/DESIGN.md.

        config BUDDY_THEME_PAPER
            bool "Paper (day)"
        config BUDDY_THEME_EMBER
            bool "Ember (night)"
    endchoice

    config BUDDY_UI_REDUCED_MOTION
        bool "Reduce interface motion"
        default n
        help
            Captions appear and disappear without sliding or fading.
            The face itself still blinks and changes expression.

endmenu
